\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Main core of the proposed pipeline for generating global descriptors from multimodal data. The pipeline integrates camera and LiDAR pre-processing, deep multimodal fusion, and a semantic–geometry-guided descriptor learning module. RGB panoramic images and projected LiDAR point clouds are processed through dedicated branches and fused to generate semantically enriched map features. A backprojection and refinement module reconstructs the semantic point representation in 3D space, which is subsequently used to learn a compact global scene descriptor.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:semantically-learned-global-descriptor-pipeline}{{2}{5}{}{figure.2}{}}
